WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Start with a publicly posted software agreement.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Select the institutional review rules inside Word. All 19 groups are selected.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Set the demonstration context, risk assessment, and rule labels.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Run the review. Processing time is shortened in this recording.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The add-in completes all 19 rule groups and leaves tracked proposals.

6
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Inspect proposed changes to contract precedence and unilateral updates.

7
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Read the indemnity and breach-cost proposals beside their rule-linked explanations.

8
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Check how the proposed liability exception relates to indemnity and breach costs.

9
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:06.000
Ask what the qualified reviewer still needs to confirm.

10
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:10.000
A qualified reviewer decides on every proposed change.
